sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant W as React Web
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SVC as AuthService/JobService
    participant AZ as AuthorizationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DSP as OutboxDispatcher
    participant R as Redis (broker)
    participant WK as Celery Worker
    participant L as WorkerLease
    participant S3 as MinIO
    participant AUD as AuditRecorder

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over U,AUD: 流程 A — 登录 + 刷新令牌旋转 + 重放检测
    U->>W: 提交邮箱+密码
    W->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>SVC: login(email, password)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT app_user WHERE email
    SVC->>SVC: argon2id.verify()
    alt 校验通过
        SVC->>DB: INSERT refresh_session(family_id=new, digest, +7d)
        SVC->>AUD: record(auth.login)
        SVC-->>API: TokenPair(access 15min, refresh 7d)
        API-->>W: 200 + HttpOnly SameSite Cookie
    else 校验失败
        SVC-->>API: AppError(invalid_credentials)
        API-->>W: 401
    end

    Note over W,DB: 15 分钟后 access token 过期
    W->>API: POST /auth/refresh (Cookie)
    API->>SVC: refresh(token)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT refresh_session WHERE digest FOR UPDATE
    alt 未撤销且未过期 (正常旋转)
        SVC->>DB: UPDATE 当前行 revoked, replaced_by=new; INSERT 新行
        SVC-->>API: 新 TokenPair
        API-->>W: 200 + 新 Cookie
    else 已撤销 (重放攻击)
        SVC->>DB: UPDATE refresh_session SET revoked WHERE family_id (整族撤销)
        SVC->>AUD: record(auth.refresh_replayed)
        SVC-->>API: AppError(refresh_replayed)
        API-->>W: 401
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note over U,AUD: 流程 B — 作业提交 → Outbox → Celery → 租约 → 幂等提交
    U->>W: 提交作业 (kind, payload, idem_key)
    W->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs
    API->>AZ: require(user, "job:create", org)
    AZ-->>API: ok
    API->>SVC: accept(kind, payload, key)
    SVC->>DB: BEGIN; INSERT job(accepted); INSERT outbox_event(job.accepted); COMMIT
    SVC-->>API: JobRef
    API-->>W: 202 {job_id}

    loop 每 200ms
        DSP->>DB: SELECT * FROM outbox_event WHERE delivered_at IS NULL
        DSP->>R: celery.send_task(job_id)
        DSP->>DB: UPDATE outbox_event SET delivered_at=now
    end

    WK->>L: acquire(job_id, owner, ttl=30s)
    L->>DB: UPDATE job SET lease_owner, lease_expires_at, status=running WHERE 租约空闲
    alt 租约冲突
        L-->>WK: false → 任务不 ACK, Redis 重投
    else 租约获取
        loop 每 10s 心跳
            WK->>L: heartbeat → 续租
        end
        WK->>S3: 写中间产物 tmp/jobs/<job_id>/
        WK->>DB: BEGIN; UPDATE job SET status=succeeded, result WHERE id AND lock_version; COMMIT
        Note over WK,DB: UNIQUE(org_id, idempotency_key) 拦截重复提交
        WK->>L: release
    end

    Note over WK,DB: Worker 崩溃 → 心跳停止
    DSP->>L: reap_expired()
    L->>DB: UPDATE job SET status=queued, lease_owner=NULL WHERE lease_expires_at<now
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over U,AUD: 流程 C — 工件上传 (预签名 + 去重 + 鉴权)
    U->>W: 选择文件
    W->>API: POST /artifacts/presign-upload {filename, size, sha256}
    API->>AZ: require(user, "artifact:write", org)
    API->>SVC: presign_upload(meta)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT artifact_blob WHERE sha256
    alt 已存在 (秒传)
        SVC->>DB: INSERT artifact (指向已有 blob)
        SVC-->>API: ArtifactRef
        API-->>W: 201 {artifact_id, deduplicated:true}
    else 不存在
        SVC->>S3: presign PUT sha256/<前2>/<digest>
        SVC-->>API: {upload_url}
        API-->>W: 200 {upload_url}
        W->>S3: PUT 文件 (直传)
        W->>API: POST /artifacts/complete {object_key, sha256}
        API->>SVC: 校验 size + sha256 + media_type
        SVC->>DB: BEGIN; INSERT artifact_blob; INSERT artifact; COMMIT
        SVC->>AUD: record(artifact.upload)
        SVC-->>API: ArtifactRef
        API-->>W: 201 {artifact_id}
    end
    end
